2026-08-18T15:51:39.9570475Z mu2 = y2 ~ x1
2026-08-18T15:51:39.9570651Z sigma1 = ~x1
2026-08-18T15:51:39.9570828Z sigma2 = ~x2
2026-08-18T15:51:39.9571079Z rho12 = ~x1 + x2
