2026-08-18T15:51:39.9580531Z > ### Name: drm_phylo_penalty
2026-08-18T15:51:39.9581126Z > ### Title: Penalty / prior specification for a phylogenetic location-scale
2026-08-18T15:51:39.9581754Z > ###   fit
2026-08-18T15:51:39.9582065Z > ### Aliases: drm_phylo_penalty
