2026-08-18T15:51:39.9763246Z                   mu:(Intercept)          mu:x sigma:(Intercept)
2026-08-18T15:51:39.9763391Z mu:(Intercept)      7.145752e-03 -3.575043e-17      2.005656e-14
2026-08-18T15:51:39.9763516Z mu:x               -3.575043e-17  9.012661e-03     -5.755220e-15
2026-08-18T15:51:39.9763662Z sigma:(Intercept)   2.005656e-14 -5.755220e-15      1.388888e-02
