2026-08-18T15:51:39.9841665Z > 
2026-08-18T15:51:39.9841778Z > bf(y ~ x + (1 | id), sigma ~ z, sd(id) ~ habitat)
2026-08-18T15:51:39.9841860Z <drm_formula>
2026-08-18T15:51:39.9841937Z y ~ x + (1 | id)
2026-08-18T15:51:39.9842009Z sigma ~ z
